```
> rommgr scan D:\ROMs
Scanned: D:\ROMs
Files seen:            4 821
ROMs detected:         4 203
ROMs skipped (cached): 0
Saves detected:        312
Assets detected:       180
Unknown files:         126

> rommgr match
